    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22797" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γραπτ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>painted</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῷα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					128.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					764
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύρβις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Achae.
					19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰκών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					1068.21
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Patmos</span>): <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γραπτά, τά</span>,
			<i>paintings</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλυπτά</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>marked as with letters</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁ γραπτὰ ὑάκινθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					10.28
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. λίθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.1089
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>written</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμοι γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gorg.
					<u>Pal.</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				773e
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσφάλεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PAmh.</u>
					78.17
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γραπτά, τά</span>, <i>rescripts,
				proclamations</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				2
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>Ma</u>
				11.15
			</span></i>; <i>legal documents, bonds</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Man.
				3.214
			</span></i>.</div>
